{"id":"8372f8b6f584a62e","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-effective-open-strategies.md","title":"有效开放博弈的策略复杂度","display":"thm-effective-open-strategies — 有效开放博弈的策略复杂度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-effective-open-strategies","aliases":["20-thm-effective-open-strategies"],"display":"thm-effective-open-strategies — 有效开放博弈的策略复杂度","chapter":"15","section":"15.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 15.1.2(i)–(iii) 的本地证明","source_pdf_pages":[247],"source_printed_pages":[218],"depends_on":["[[20-df-gale-stewart]]","[[20-lem-open-winning-certificate]]","[[20-df-closed-winning-strategies]]","[[20-thm-low-basis]]","[[20-df-low-high]]","[[20-thm-jump]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-effective-open-strategies"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-effective-open-strategies</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-effective-open-strategies — 有效开放博弈的策略复杂度"},{"key":"chapter","html":"15"},{"key":"section","html":"15.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 15.1.2(i)–(iii) 的本地证明"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>247</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>218</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" href=\"?note=f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" title=\"20-df-gale-stewart\">20-df-gale-stewart</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8609481d2b84cdde\" href=\"?note=8609481d2b84cdde\" title=\"20-lem-open-winning-certificate\">20-lem-open-winning-certificate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3225aa77bce6f46a\" href=\"?note=3225aa77bce6f46a\" title=\"20-df-closed-winning-strategies\">20-df-closed-winning-strategies</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"04a511cfa9ffa494\" href=\"?note=04a511cfa9ffa494\" title=\"20-thm-low-basis\">20-thm-low-basis</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为有效开类；策略依固定的全部回合枚举编码为二进制实。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" href=\"?note=f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" title=\"20-df-gale-stewart\">20-df-gale-stewart</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8609481d2b84cdde\" href=\"?note=8609481d2b84cdde\" title=\"20-lem-open-winning-certificate\">20-lem-open-winning-certificate</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3225aa77bce6f46a\" href=\"?note=3225aa77bce6f46a\" title=\"20-df-closed-winning-strategies\">20-df-closed-winning-strategies</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"04a511cfa9ffa494\" href=\"?note=04a511cfa9ffa494\" title=\"20-thm-low-basis\">20-thm-low-basis</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}effective-open-strategies}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n(\\exists s\\ \\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A))\\Rightarrow\\exists s\\le_T\\varnothing\\ \\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A),\\\\\n(\\exists s\\ \\operatorname{Win}_{II}(s,A))\\Rightarrow\n\\exists s\\ [\\operatorname{Win}_{II}(s,A)\\land\\operatorname{Low}_1(s)\\land s\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}effective-open-strategies}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n(\\exists s\\ \\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A))\\Rightarrow\\exists s\\le_T\\varnothing\\ \\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A),\\\\\n(\\exists s\\ \\operatorname{Win}_{II}(s,A))\\Rightarrow\n\\exists s\\ [\\operatorname{Win}_{II}(s,A)\\land\\operatorname{Low}_1(s)\\land s\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>I 的任意胜策由有限分枝紧致性给有限获胜证书。有限表记录证书内部的行动，其他全部历史取默认位，故是全可计算胜策。该搜索在 I 必胜承诺下终止；索引编译与承诺全定义性另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"cd307d59aba6545f\" href=\"?note=cd307d59aba6545f\" title=\"20-thm-open-winning-strategy-compiler\">20-thm-open-winning-strategy-compiler</a>。</p>\n<p>II 必胜时，其全部胜策的编码类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal W_{II}(S)\">\\(\\mathcal W_{II}(S)\\)</span> 非空有效闭；Low Basis 给低成员 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>，对应的全策略即获胜。一般跳跃性质 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\le_T g&#39;\\equiv_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(g\\le_T g&#39;\\equiv_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 给所列上界。每个二值全策略都具有固定实编码，因此这里的 low 谓词和 Turing 归约有明确载体。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 15.1.2(i)–(iii)；印刷 218 / PDF 247。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-gale-stewart","status":"resolved","id":"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-gale-stewar